<title>USA: Schroder Asian Growth March 21 NAV $13.04.</title>
<headline>Schroder Asian Growth March 21 NAV $13.04.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Asian Growth Fund Inc said Monday its net aset value calculated as of the close of trading on March 21 was $13.04.</p>
<p>The net asset value as of that date is the amount that it will pay for shares tendered under its buyback offer for 3.5 million shares.</p>
<p>In a previous announcement, the fund said that about 13.3 million shares or 67 percent of the total outstanding shares have been tendered under the offer.</p>
</text>
